hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1749","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchaatey hain, Aap ne farmaya: Jab Allah aasmaan mein muamley ka faisla karta hai to farishtey apne paron ko maartey hain, uskey qaul key liye aajizi mein, zanjeer jaisa sakht patthar par. Phir jab unkey dilon se ghabrahat door hoti hai to wo kehtey hain: Tumhaarey Rab ne kya farmaya? Wo kehtey hain jis ne haq kaha, jabke wo Buland Bada hai. To use kaan laga kar sun-ney waley suntey hain. Aur kaan laga kar sun-ney waley aise hain, aik doosrey key upar. To baaz auqaat shoala sun-ney waley ko us se pehley paa leta hai ke wo use apne saathi ki taraf phenkey aur use jala de. Aur baaz auqaat use nahi paata yahan tak ke wo use uski taraf phenkey jo us se milta hai, jo us se neechey hai. Yahan tak ke wo use zameen tak daal detey hain. To wo jaadugar key munh par daali jaati hai. To wo uskey sath sau jhoot bolta hai. To use sacha kaha jaata hai. To wo kehtey hain: Kya us ne hamein fulaan fulaan din khabar nahi di thi ke aisa aisa hoga aur ham ne use haq paaya? Us kalimat key liye jo aasmaan se suni gai thi. (Bukhari: 4701). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur tum mein se koi intehaai budhapey ki taraf lautaya jaata hai)."
